t ALGO.\n- **Finite-size effects:**\n  - If needed, increase `box_padding` (e.g., 12–15 Å) and rerun SP.\n\n## Deliverables\n- VASP input decks (relax + SP) and completed VASP outputs.\n- Reported from VASP results:\n  - **Final total energy** and **energy per atom (eV/atom)**.\n  - **Relaxed O–O bond distance (Å)**.\n- A concise machine-readable summary in `results/` plus MEMORY updates.\n", "work_packages": ["Generate O₂ gas-phase structure in a sufficiently large cubic box (POSCAR/XYZ)", "Prepare VASP relaxation inputs (gas preset) with enforced triplet spin state (NUPDOWN/MAGMOM)", "Execute VASP relaxation and validate completion/convergence (forces + electronic + magnetization)", "Prepare and execute a single-point calculation at the relaxed geometry for final energy reporting", "Postprocess outputs to extract final energy per atom and O–O bond length; write results artifact and update MEMORY"], "error": "", "needs_human": false}
