y export exists: `structures/o2/o2.xyz`.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[1] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_01).\n\n- Parsed POSCAR geometry invariants (ASE verification): cubic cell lengths = 21.151, 21.151, 21.151 Å.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[2] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_01).\n\n- Parsed O–O Cartesian bond distance = 1.151 Å (within expected molecular range for initial O2 geometry).\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[3] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_01).\n\n- Species order in parsed POSCAR is `O O`.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[4] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_01).\n\n- Molecule is centered in the box: COM = (10.575, 10.575, 10.575) Å with minimum boundary clearance 10.575 Å.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[5] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_01).\n\n- WP2 preparation succeeded: `vasp_relax_prepare` ran on `structures/o2/o2.vasp` with `calc_type=gas`, producing `vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2`.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[0] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_02).\n\n- Prepared VASP input set is complete at `vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2`: `INCAR`, `KPOINTS`, `POSCAR`, `POTCAR` all present.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[1] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_02).\n\n- INCAR gas-relaxation controls validated: `EDIFF=1e-06`, `EDIFFG=-0.02` (eV/Å force criterion), `NSW=500`, `ISIF=2`, `ISYM=0`, `LREAL=False`.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[2] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_02).\n\n- Triplet-spin invariants are explicitly present in INCAR: `ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`, `MAGMOM=2*1`.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts[3] (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=task_02).\n\n- KPOINTS sampling is Γ-only `1×1×1`, consistent with isolated molecule in large box.\n  - Evidenc