12:28:06 INFO catmaster.runtime.artifact_callback | [llm.context.message] model=openai/gpt-5.3-codex:online callback_run_id=019caccd-ad66-7f91-bafd-ceaa7e92665b batch=0 idx=1 class=HumanMessage type=human payload={"content": "\nRun id: run_20260302_041302_4e65c2\nTask id: task_04\nTask goal (short): Prepare and run a VASP single-point (NSW=0) calculation for O2 using the relaxed geometry from the completed relaxation run.\nOutcome: success\n\nTask structured result (JSON):\n{\"summary\": \"Prepared and executed an O2 gas-phase VASP single-point run from the relaxed CONTCAR. SP inputs were generated at vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR, triplet settings in INCAR were enforced (ISPIN=2, NUPDOWN=2, MAGMOM=1 1), and VASP was run in single-folder mode with outputs at vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR. OUTCAR indicates normal termination and required output files are present.\", \"facts\": [\"Relaxed structure located and used: vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/CONTCAR.\", \"vasp_sp_prepare completed with calc_type=gas; prepared directory: vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR.\", \"Triplet INCAR keys in SP input are present as ISPIN = 2, MAGMOM = 1 1, NUPDOWN = 2 (verified by grep).\", \"vasp_execute_batch completed for input_dir=vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR; output directory: vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR.\", \"OUTCAR in vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR contains \\\"General timing and accounting informations for this job\\\" (line 1935), confirming normal termination.\", \"File presence check passed in vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR: OUTCAR, OSZICAR, vasprun.xml, and CONTCAR/POSCAR condition satisfied.\"], \"files\": [{\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP single-point input directory for O2 (gas, Gamma-only).\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/INCAR\", \"description\": \"SP INCAR patched to enforce triplet settings (ISPIN=2, NUPDOWN=2, MAGMOM=1 1).\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"VASP single-point run output directory.\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/_BATCH_STATE.json\", \"description\": \"Batch execution state record from vasp_execute_batch.\", \"kind\": \"log\"}], \"constraints\": [], \"open_questions\": [], \"decisions\": [{\"decision\": \"Used the relaxation CONTCAR directly as the SP starting geometry.\", \"rationale\": \"Task explicitly prefers relaxed CONTCAR from prior relax outputs.\"}, {\"decision\": \"Patched INCAR after vasp_sp_prepare to set NUPDOWN=2 and MAGMOM=1 1.\", \"rationale\": \"Prepare tool did not set NUPDOWN and had a non-target MAGMOM; triplet enforcement is required.\"}], \"next_steps\": [], \"artifacts\": []}\n\nEditable file snapshot (authoritative):\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/MEMORY.md\">\n# MEMORY (AUTOLOADED INDEX)\n\n## What this is\n- Autoloaded memory index for this project.\n- Keep this file concise and pointer-first.\n- Put details in MEMORY/topics/*.md.\n\n## Latest State\n- Current focus: Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n- Current milestone: WP3 completed (task_id=task_03, 2026-03-02): gas-phase O2 triplet relaxation executed, finished normally, and met ionic/electronic convergence checks.\n- Latest run artifact: `vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2` contains converged run outputs (`OUTCAR`, `OSZICAR`, `CONTCAR`, `vasprun.xml`); verification details are in `MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md`.\n- Next action: WP4 — extract/report final energy per atom and relaxed O–O bond distance from converged outputs.\n\n## Top Constraints\n1. (empty)\n\n## Active Open Questions\n1. (empty)\n\n## Pointers\n- Goal / principles: MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\n- Facts / decisions: MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\n- Files / artifacts: MEMORY/topics/FILES.md\n- Constraints: MEMORY/topics/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- Open questions: MEMORY/topics/QUESTIONS.md\n- Runbook: MEMORY/topics/RUNBOOK.md\n\n## Keyword Map\n- GOAL: objective, success criteria, scope, non-goals\n- FACTS: definition, verified, result, decision\n- FILES: path, artifact, dataset, output, script\n- CONSTRAINTS: must, cannot, policy, budget\n- QUESTIONS: unknown, blocked, clarify, decide\n- RUNBOOK: steps, checklist, verify\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\">\n# GOAL\n\n## TL;DR\n- Primary objective: Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n- Definition of success:\n- Non-goals:\n\n## Objectives\n- (empty)\n\n## Success Criteria\n- (empty)\n\n## Non-goals\n- (empty)\n\n## Change log\n- [2026-03-02] Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\">\n# FACTS\n\n## TL;DR\n- Canonical definitions: Gas-phase O2 reference setup uses triplet spin in a large cubic box with standard PBE/PAW settings.\n- Verified facts: Planning is committed, WP1 structure-generation invariants are satisfied, WP2 VASP relaxation inputs were generated with gas-phase controls and explicit triplet enforcement, and WP3 relaxation run finished normally with convergence/triplet consistency.\n- Tentative hypotheses: (empty)\n\n## Canonical Definitions\n- Gas-phase O2 project setup target (planning baseline): PBE (PAW_PBE 5.4 / MPRelaxSet), cubic box with ~10 Å padding (~20 Å cell), and triplet state (S=1) enforced via spin controls (e.g., NUPDOWN/MAGMOM).\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.facts (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=plan_commit).\n\n## Verified Facts\n- Plan status: committed for execution.\n  - Evidence: task packet structured_result.summary (run_id=run_20260302_041302_4e65c2, task_id=plan_commit).\n\n- Approved execution decomposition: 5 work packages (WP1–WP5).\n  - Evidence: task 