scription\": \"Prepared VASP relaxation input set for gas-phase O2 (INCAR/KPOINTS/POSCAR/POTCAR).\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Patched INCAR after generation to add/override NUPDOWN and MAGMOM for explicit triplet enforcement. (The preparation tool schema does not expose user_incar_settings directly, so a minimal post-generation edit was required to satisfy spin invariants.)\"], \"facts\": [\"vasp_relax_prepare succeeded for structures/o2/o2.vasp with calc_type=gas; prepared directory: vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2.\", \"File existence check passed: INCAR, KPOINTS, POSCAR, POTCAR all exist under vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2.\", \"INCAR contains EDIFF=1e-06, EDIFFG=-0.02, NSW=500, ISIF=2, ISYM=0, LREAL=False.\", \"Triplet constraints enforced in INCAR: ISPIN=2, NUPDOWN=2, MAGMOM=2*1.\", \"KPOINTS is Gamma-centered 1x1x1.\"]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_03\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Executed VASP in single-folder mode for prepared O2 gas-phase triplet input at `vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2`, with outputs collected under `vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2`. Post-run checks from OUTCAR/OSZICAR indicate normal completion, ionic/electronic convergence, and triplet-consistent spin state.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2\", \"description\": \"Completed O2 relaxation run directory containing OUTCAR, OSZICAR, CONTCAR, vasprun.xml, and other VASP outputs.\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/_BATCH_STATE.json\", \"description\": \"Batch execution state record from DPDispatcher wrapper.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}], \"decisions\": [\"No rerun/fix cycle applied. (Initial run already satisfied normal-finish and convergence checks, including SCF/force and triplet spin consistency.)\"], \"facts\": [\"Run execution succeeded via `vasp_execute_batch` with output folder `vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2`.\", \"VASP normal termination detected in OUTCAR via presence of final timing/accounting section.\", \"No fatal-error signatures detected in OUTCAR (checked for common fatal patterns).\", \"Final ionic max force = 0.005452 eV/Å from the last TOTAL-FORCE block in OUTCAR.\", \"Convergence criterion from INCAR/OUTCAR: EDIFFG = -0.02 eV/Å, so force criterion is met (0.005452 < 0.02).\", \"Run did not stop due to NSW exhaustion (`nsw_exhausted=false`).\", \"Final total energy (free energy) from OUTCAR: TOTEN = -9.88462988 eV.\", \"Spin constraint/readback: NUPDOWN = 2.0.\"]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_04\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Prepared and executed an O2 gas-phase VASP single-point run from the relaxed CONTCAR. SP inputs were generated at vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR, triplet settings in INCAR were enforced (ISPIN=2, NUPDOWN=2, MAGMOM=1 1), and VASP was run in single-folder mode with outputs at vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR. OUTCAR indicates normal termination and required output files are present.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP single-point input directory for O2 (gas, Gamma-only).\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/INCAR\", \"description\": \"SP INCAR patched to enforce triplet settings (ISPIN=2, NUPDOWN=2, MAGMOM=1 1).\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"VASP single-point run output directory.\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/_BATCH_STATE.json\", \"description\": \"Batch execution state record from vasp_execute_batch.\", \"kind\": \"log\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Used the relaxation CONTCAR directly as the SP starting geometry. (Task explicitly prefers relaxed CONTCAR from prior relax outputs.)\", \"Patched INCAR after vasp_sp_prepare to set NUPDOWN=2 and MAGMOM=1 1. (Prepare tool did not set NUPDOWN and had a non-target MAGMOM; triplet enforcement is required.)\"], \"facts\": [\"Relaxed structure located and used: vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/CONTCAR.\", \"vasp_sp_prepare completed with calc_type=gas; prepared directory: vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR.\", \"Triplet INCAR keys in SP input are present as ISPIN = 2, MAGMOM = 1 1, NUPDOWN = 2 (verified by grep).\", \"vasp_execute_batch completed for input_dir=vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR; output directory: vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR.\", \"OUTCAR in vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR contains \\\"General timing and accounting informations for this job\\\" (line 1935), confirming normal termination.\", \"File presence check passed in vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR: OUTCAR, OSZICAR, vasprun.xml, and CONTCAR/POSCAR condition satisfied.\"]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_05\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Extracted final O2 single-point energy and bond length from `vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR` and wrote machine-readable summary to `results/o2_vasp_summary.json`. Energy was read from `vasprun.xml` (pymatgen), geometry from `CONTCAR` (ASE), with sanity checks (2 atoms, O/O) and OUTCAR normal-termination marker check.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"results/o2_vasp_summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable summary of source directory, energies, O–O distance, timestamp, and parse metadata.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Use `vasprun.xml` as primary energy source and only fallback to OUTCAR TOTEN regex if needed. (Task detail requested OUTCAR last TOTEN or vasprun.xml if available; vasprun.xml was available and parsed successfully.)\"], \"facts\": [\"Source directory used: `vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR`.\", \"Final total energy: -9.88463003 eV (from `vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/vasprun.xml`).\", \"Energy per atom: -4.942315015 eV/atom.\", \"O–O bond distance: 1.233252560278 Å (from `vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/CONTCAR`).\", \"Sanity checks passed: atom count = 2, species = O and O.\", \"OUTCAR normal termination marker present: True.\", \"Parsing fallback note: no fallback needed; used `Vasprun.final_energy` from `vasprun.xml`.\"]}]\n\nArtifact list:\n[{\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/vasprun.xml\", \"description\": \"Structured XML results for completed O2 single-point run\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/OUTCAR\", \"description\": \"Primary log for O2 single-point run with normal-termination confirmation\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/OSZICAR\", \"description\": \"SCF iteration summary for O2 single-point calculation\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Completed O2 single-point run directory from relaxed geometry\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/vasprun.xml\", \"description\": \"Structured XML results for the converged O2 relaxation\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/OUTCAR\", \"description\": \"Primary run log with termination, force, energy, and magnetization readback used for convergence verification\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/OSZICAR\", \"description\": \"Ionic/electronic iteration summary for converged O2 relaxation\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Relaxed final geometry from converged O2 run\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/o2\", \"description\": \"Completed O2 gas-phase relaxation run directory containing VASP outputs\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_relax/o2/_BATCH_STATE.json\", \"description\": \"DPDispatcher batch execution state record for O2 relaxation run submission/execution\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR/INCAR\", \"description\": \"Single-point INCAR with explicit triplet controls (`ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`, `MAGMOM=1 1`)\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_sp/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP single-point input directory for O2 using relaxed CONTCAR geometry (gas-phase setup)\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_relax/o2\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP relaxation input set for gas-phase O2 (INCAR/KPOINTS/POSCAR/POTCAR) with triplet enforcement applied in INCAR\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"results/o2_vasp_summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable WP5 summary with source directory, final total energy, energy per atom, O–O bond distance, and parse/termination checks\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"structures/o2/o2.xyz\", \"description\": \"Gas-phase O2 XYZ coordinates matching the POSCAR geometry\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"structures/o2/o2.vasp\", \"description\": \"Gas-phase O2 in a large cubic VASP cell (2 O atoms; cubic cell ~21.151 Å)\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}]","role":"user"}],"model":"openai/gpt-5-nano","stream":false,"temperature":1.0,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h"}
